    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You let out a howl that inspires your allies to do their utmost. You and any allies who can hear or see your howl gain a +1 circumstance bonus to their next saving throw within the next minute. If you become Legendary in any of this feat’s prerequisite skills, an ally can use a reaction to howl back to increase this circumstance bonus to a +2. After receiving its effects, a creature cannot benefit from Commanding Howl until an hour has passed.</span></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.Dn9bbIOW2CQS9iYe]{Effect: Commanding Howl}</p>"
